     A**
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  This file will be used to track WCMC A/R invoice activity at a
     A*  summary level: simply by invoice# and invoice transaction date
     A*  .  This information will be used in the A./R Inquiry programs
     A*  (N0419R and N0420R) to control sorting and views.  An NMIMP
     A*  record is created in the following programs: N7120R, N0440R
     A*  and N9300R.
     A*
     A*  Created 04/24/00 by C:62 for project AR001
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  REVISIONS:
     A*
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A** Invoice Master File
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PIM01                     TEXT('Invoice Master File')
     A            IMCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            IMSUB#    R               REFFLD(SUB#)
     A            IMFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            IMFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            IMCASE    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A            IMINV#    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Invoice Number')
     A            IMTRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Transaction Date')
     A            IMSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            IMUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maintenance User')
     A            IMPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maintenance Program')
     A            IMTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maintenance Time')
     A            IMDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maintenance Date')
     A            IMIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            IMIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Program')
     A            IMITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
     A            IMIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
